{"title":"Convos, Bites & Banter 🤣 (Gladstone Hotel)","startsAt":"2026-10-15T19:15:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-15T21:30:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Hey ladies!\n\nLet's check out Cassette at **The Gladstone Hotel** on Queen West for some convo games, rants 😂 and storytelling. 🍸💬✨\n\n**EVENT:**\n**Open Ended** is a social \"storytellers and storylisteners\" night inspired by conversation cards, hot takes, and random topics to get everyone chatting!\n\nThis would be such a vibe as a group! 🙌🏾 Some topics can be kept at the table, and some can be shared with the room (you can always change the names to protect the \"innocent\" 🤣)\n\nThere is a \"live storytelling element\", but **NO pressure for everyone to \"grab the mic\"** (but we will support you if you do 👩🏿‍🦱 👩🏼 👩🏽‍🦱 !)\n\n**Once confirmed**, tickets will be purchased together so no one is truly \"solo\".\n\n**VENUE:** 📍\nCassette is a newish restaurant/bar near Queen & Gladstone, carrying an artsy/social energy with a range of live music, comedy, karaoke, trivia and community events.\n\nCheck out their [menu](https://www.cassetteto.com/menu) below for cocktails, comfort food and more! Any food and drink ordered will be at **your own expense**:\nhttps://www.cassetteto.com/menu\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**IMPORTANT:**\n*A **minimum number** is required to proceed as a \"group\". Once CONFIRMED, I'll collect payment in advance in a week or so. **This meetup is ONLY for the group purchase.***\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n**DETAILS:** 🎟️\n\n* Sign up to the waitlist to join us!\n* At the time of posting, tickets are $25 ($20 + SCSC's $5 non-refundable RSVP fee)\n* Etransfers will be required in advance\n* All ticket sales are final (as per ticket seller)\n\nHere's a sample of [their last \"Open Ended\"](https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/open-ended-a-storytelling-night-tickets-1994954486572) event:\nhttps://www.eventbrite.ca/e/open-ended-a-storytelling-night-tickets-1994954486572\n\nLooking forward to seeing both new and familiar faces!","venue":{"name":"Gladstone House","address":"1214 Queen St W, Toronto, ON M6J 1J6, Canada, Toronto","lat":43.642698,"lng":-79.426906,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Solo & Childfree* Social Club (for Women ONLY - 30s/40s/50s)","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/2/a/e/2/highres_536170978.jpeg"}